sequenceDiagram
autonumber
actor U as Staff member
participant App as SkirtAndTeeApp
participant SI as SignInScreen
participant Ses as SessionViewModel
participant StR as StaffRepositoryImpl
participant DB as SQLite
participant Sh as AppShell

App->>Ses: current == null?
App->>SI: show sign-in
alt no staff yet (first run)
  U->>SI: name + new PIN
  SI->>Ses: createFirstOwner(name, pin)
  Ses->>StR: add(name, owner, pin)
  StR->>StR: random salt, hashPin (10,000× SHA-256)
  StR->>DB: INSERT staff
else accounts exist
  U->>SI: pick name, enter PIN
  SI->>Ses: signIn(member, pin)
  Ses->>StR: verifyPin(id, pin)
  StR->>DB: SELECT pinHash, salt
  StR-->>Ses: match?
  alt wrong PIN
    Ses-->>SI: false
    SI-->>U: "Wrong PIN"
  end
end
Ses->>DB: audit_log "Signed in"
Ses-->>App: notifyListeners()
App->>Sh: show shell (menu filtered by role)
Note over Sh: Cashier sees POS, Inventory (read-only), Reservations
U->>Sh: Lock
Sh->>Ses: cart.clear(), signOut()
Ses-->>App: back to SignInScreen
